[{"title":"偈颂二十四首 其一","author":"释智愚","text":"约束万象，耸动人天。\n风云会合，来自日边，纵饶海口亦难宣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20003,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其十二","author":"释智愚","text":"十万里水云踪迹，七百年西竺陈人。\n眼睛乌律卒，面子黑鳞皴。\n传衣付法，惹起埃尘。\n如今红紫乱朱纷然而出，岂止乎少林五叶一花之春。\n斯临远讳，荐此溪蘋，万古千秋累子孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20004,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其十一","author":"释智愚","text":"远之莫及故曰短，踪之不即故曰蓬。\n波波浪浪，西西东东。\n直钩已挂双峨碧，一桡香散芦花风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20005,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其十","author":"释智愚","text":"我本无心有所希求，今此宝藏自然而至。\n二林小众，枯枯燥燥，鹤望多时。\n珊瑚枕，明月珠，从便采取，只是不得触讳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20006,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其八","author":"释智愚","text":"葱岭不见宋云，全身岂在熊耳。\n石火电光殊莫拟，双梼堂上再相逢。\n究竟何曾缺两齿，雪际传心，筛灰厌鬼，后代儿孙谁来。\n你粗羹淡饭当殷勤，四海香风从此起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20007,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其七","author":"释智愚","text":"华亭满船犹不足，南泉骤步蹈不著。\n自馀眼底纷纷，总道见月忘指。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20008,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其六","author":"释智愚","text":"老和尚死去二十五年，有谁撑门拄户。\n虽与松源同日行，不会松源三转语。\n父子背驰，面不相睹，直至如今成莽卤。\n露冷风高秋意深，久矣无心荐藜黍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20009,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其五","author":"释智愚","text":"净瓶里澡洗，古梼下修身。\n彼此寸长尺短，何妨忝为切邻。\n相见又无事，不来还忆君。\n杜鹃啼断月如昼，不似寻常空过春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20010,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其四","author":"释智愚","text":"伤弓之鸟，见曲木而高飞。\n有人见得云门，善为我辞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20011,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十三首 其三","author":"释智愚","text":"水中盐味，色里胶青。\n祖师只认得个相似底，何异楚人以鸡为凤。\n我者里任你三头六臂，尽其来机，也无你凑泊处。\n惯将三尺喙，骂倒五湖僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20012,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"密庵和尚赞","author":"释智愚","text":"行脚不到大彻堂前，刚要凌灭应庵门户。\n指柳骂杨，吹沙嗅土，却笑谢郎眉忒竖。\n欲识中峰个里人，无尾大虫不是虎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20013,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"维摩示疾图赞","author":"释智愚","text":"一生口嘴唠嘈，偏要搀行夺市。\n诈病毗耶离城，引得许多闲神野鬼稽首净名。\n咄，我不识你。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20014,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"船子和尚赞","author":"释智愚","text":"烟水寒，扁舟小，华亭江上相寻讨。\n负命底劈口一桡，点头处狼藉不少。\n父子怯相酬，谁道翻身早。\n出黄芦，入红蓼。\n收拾丝纶，江天未晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20015,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪窦显禅师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"凝而不结，混而常清。\n挺然岳立，卒乎砥平。\n拟师之道兮虚空钉橛，美师之德兮色重里胶青。\n妙高万叠兮春归锦镜，翠螺一抹兮霜后洞庭。\n在彼在此兮初无朕迹，或舒或卷兮水赴沧溟，遐想高躅兮实我法城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20016,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄龙南禅师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"山泐潭之水，奋衡山之云。\n三关多漏网，谁是负恩人，晦堂之下有清新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20017,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒山作吟身势赞","author":"释智愚","text":"一句子，有也未。\n蹙断眉头，做尽手势。\n靠倒维摩记得无，至今一默喧天地。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20018,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒山拾得赞 其一","author":"释智愚","text":"爨下偷僧饭，崖根抱虎眠。\n懒吟长短句，来把梵书看。\n真个看，牛皮也须穿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20019,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒山拾得赞 其二","author":"释智愚","text":"帚柄不忘，寸心未息。\n冷眼看人，多少荆棘。\n咄哉遗弃小儿，丰干草里拾得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20020,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒山拾得赞","author":"释智愚","text":"五峰石上，双涧松边。\n是者伎俩，莫骂丰干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20021,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒山背身立赞","author":"释智愚","text":"骂丰干，是者汉。\n竹筒盛菜柦，指出教人见。\n其实只要知机，不欲彰头露面。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20022,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒拾问讯赞","author":"释智愚","text":"金银窟里出来，彼此囊无一镪。\n斗贫不斗富，做尽穷伎俩。\n大虫来也，急须合掌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20023,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"智者大师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"太虚无云，清镜无痕。\n如意举手，花雨缤纷。\n契南岳不传之旨，见灵山未散之人。\n妙圆体极，即相非真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20024,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝阳对月赞","author":"释智愚","text":"寒暑不到处，山穷石自枯。\n涕零知骨冷，随分著工夫。\n一卷无题目，持来傍石根。\n眼昏嫌字小，华梵恐难分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20025,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝阳毳衲赞","author":"释智愚","text":"针无肉，补不足。\n傍晨曦，倚岩谷。\n怕见黄叶飞，未风先皱眉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20026,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈明圆和尚赞","author":"释智愚","text":"去见神鼎諲，绝叫屋梁倒。\n不得脱手法，打折你驴腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20027,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蓬莱宣长老请赞","author":"释智愚","text":"啐啄之机，临崖一拶。\n虎啸龙吟，二九十八。\n宣禅自是恶冤家，学伊岂止顶门瞎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20028,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蹈碓老卢赞","author":"释智愚","text":"用智恰如愚，无人辨得渠。\n秕糠和月捣，意在脱衣盂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20029,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三教合一面赞","author":"释智愚","text":"龟證无功，会三归一。\n各有面子，不欲露出。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20030,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"布袋回头笑髑髅赞","author":"释智愚","text":"咄者髑髅，荒草堆头。\n敛眉一笑，万壑云收。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20031,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"礼大梅常禅师塔","author":"释智愚","text":"鼯鼠声中，颠来倒去。\n马颔驴腮，不须解注。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20032,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宏智禅师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"金凤初鸣，玉人启户。\n露冷风高，子归就父。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20033,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨岐会和尚赞","author":"释智愚","text":"灰头土面，弄假像真。\n三脚驴子，独角麒麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20034,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"净名居士赞","author":"释智愚","text":"一默雷轰，是非顿起。\n示疾毗耶，大虫无齿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20035,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弥陀古像赞","author":"释智愚","text":"有愿度生，垂手接引。\n含生不来，物无可悯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20036,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"放拄杖睡赞","author":"释智愚","text":"能所顿忘，佯佯瞌睡。\n一息不来，百川鼎沸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20037,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临际大师赞","author":"释智愚","text":"黄檗棒头，大愚肋下。\n后代儿孙，乌焉成马。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":20038,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草衣文殊赞","author":"释智愚","text":"是何等书，读不成句。\n蓑短发长，手脚俱露。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"